  "description": {
   "en": "Sano Tsukasa, a first-year university student who works part-time at a karaoke shop. One day, he encounters a female customer who used to be a children's TV singer.\r\n\r\nShe pleads with him, saying, \"If you don't mind, could you listen to just one song?\" and \"Honestly, I want to sing in front of children again, just like I used to...\" Though puzzled, Tsukasa agrees. The woman turns out to be an incredible singer, but despite performing children's songs, for some reason, her singing is irresistibly sexy..."
  },
